</td><td rowspan="1" width="98" colspan="1">5,954,513.99</td><td rowspan="1" width="99" colspan="1">101,539,820.73</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" width="252" colspan="1">筹资活动现金流出小计</td><td rowspan="1" width="98" colspan="1">12,321,532,464.95</td><td rowspan="1" width="99" colspan="1">23,251,698,441.18</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" width="252" colspan="1">筹资活动产生的现金流量净额</td><td rowspan="1" width="98" colspan="1">-4,608,532,464.95</td><td rowspan="1" width="99" colspan="1">7,095,341,558.82</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" width="252" colspan="1">四、汇率变动对现金及现金等价物的影响</td><td rowspan="1" width="98" colspan="1"></td><td rowspan="1" width="99" colspan="1"></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" width="252" colspan="1">五、现金及现金等价物净增加额</td><td rowspan="1" width="98" colspan="1">-560,862,069.51</td><td rowspan="1" width="99" colspan="1">-453,602,747.29</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" width="252" colspan="1">加：期初现金及现金等价物余额</td><td rowspan="1" width="98" colspan="1">694,155,599.20</td><td rowspan="1" width="99" colspan="1">699,277,321.34</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" width="252" colspan="1">六、期末现金及现金等价物余额</td><td rowspan="1" width="98" colspan="1">133,293,529.69</td><td rowspan="1" width="99" colspan="1">245,674,574.05</td></tr></table></div><p>法定代表人：马兴田        主管会计工作负责人：许冬瑾        会计机构负责人：庄义清</p><p>4.2 首次执行新金融工具准则、新收入准则、新租赁准则调整首次执行当年年初财务报表相关项目情况</p><p>□适用 √不适用</p><p>4.3 首次执行新金融工具准则、新租赁准则追溯调整前期比较数据的说明</p><p>□适用 √不适用</p><p>4.4 审计报告</p><p>□适用 √不适用</p><br>						</div>
